        "title": "Public visitor funnel and app-mode segmentation in Mixpanel",
        "summary": "Analytics gained an authentication flag, a complete logged-out funnel, and an app-mode super property so public and authenticated usage can finally be measured side by side.",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Every Mixpanel event now carries an is_authenticated super property, set to false at init, flipped to true on identify, and reset on logout, so authenticated and public metrics can be filtered independently.",
