              "8e2db7e53466629704cb5893b302bfafbf35dffe"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "text": "Instrumented the full logged-out funnel with public_page_viewed on shell mount, public_session_started when a guest session is created, public_message_sent (tagged with the selected mode), public_gate_shown on the KeepChattingModal, and public_login_clicked / public_signup_clicked from both the modal and the titlebar (with a source property).",
